  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5902.05 Mass Casualty Incident. Any unit or provider responding to a mass casualty incident shall follow the incident command system as defined in Saf-C 5901.54.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at Chapter heading for Saf-C 5900) #12790, eff 5-24-19",
